<http://data.silknow.org/object/4faed4ea-4373-3711-952e-d305fe3be6c3>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Handkerchief of plate-printed white silk in black with a design commemorating Doctor Sacheverell. In the centre is a portrait with the inscription 'Henry Sacheverell, D.D. Aetatis suae 36 ANo DOm 1710'. In a series of six ovals around the central are the portraits of the Archbishop of York and the bishops of Rochester, Chester, London, Durham, Bath and Wells. There is an outer and an inner border of floral ornament. The extreme outer edge is tan coloured. Lined with white silk and bound with a crimson edging."@en , "Handkerchief 'Dr Sacheverell' of plate-printed silk, England, 1710"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/15addd57-7e70-37ac-af10-fbcc94a062f9> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/4edc0d0f-cd89-3ae8-858b-dad753559b19> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/1be4b2d3-02fc-38c5-97f0-eb5d287de0f7> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Handkerchief of plate-printed white silk in black with a design commemorating Doctor Sacheverell. In the centre is a portrait with the inscription 'Henry Sacheverell, D.D. Aetatis suae 36 ANo DOm 1710'. In a series of six ovals around the central are the portraits of the Archbishop of York and the bishops of Rochester, Chester, London, Durham, Bath and Wells. There is an outer and an inner border of floral ornament. The extreme outer edge is tan coloured. Lined with white silk and bound with a crimson edging."@en , "Handkerchief 'Dr Sacheverell' of plate-printed silk, England, 1710"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/4faed4ea-4373-3711-952e-d305fe3be6c3/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/4faed4ea-4373-3711-952e-d305fe3be6c3/dimension/2> ;
